sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant V as Visitor
    participant W as web /chat
    participant A as api public router
    participant DB as Postgres (app_public role)
    participant E as FastEmbed
    participant L as LLM

    V->>W: "Java, Python and AWS in Chantilly"
    W->>A: POST /public/chat {message, prior_codes[]}
    A->>A: rate limit by client IP (trusted proxy header)
    A->>A: refusal check (candidates, résumés, who applied, phones)
    alt asks about people
        A-->>W: fixed refusal - published jobs only (no DB call)
    else job question
        A->>A: deterministic parse - skills via synonyms, city via location list, rest is full-text
        A->>DB: SELECT open jobs WHERE skills overlap AND location = city AND tsv matches
        DB-->>A: job set (SQL decides membership)
        opt job vectors exist
            A->>E: embed "search_query: ..."
            A->>A: rerank the same set by cosine
        end
        A->>L: top 8 job fields + description quotes (temperature 0.2, 30 s timeout)
        alt LLM answers
            L-->>A: short answer
            A->>A: drop any requisition code not in the retrieved set
        else LLM down or timeout
            A->>A: "Explanations are unavailable right now"
        end
        A-->>W: answer + cards (code, title, city, matched skills, confidence)
    end
    W-->>V: cards with expandable description quote
